years, I just think

160
00:08:00,090 --> 00:08:05,120
there's some subjects that
are easier starting points

161
00:08:05,120 --> 00:08:07,150
than others.

162
00:08:07,150 --> 00:08:09,160
So I'm doing what I
think is the easiest

163
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:12,340
entry to this
material with the idea

164
00:08:12,340 --> 00:08:14,620
that after you've got the
easy stuff under your belt,

165
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:17,860
it's easier to move on to
the more difficult material.

166
00:08:17,860 --> 00:08:19,630
So the order is not
precisely the same

167
00:08:19,630 --> 00:08:21,940
as that in Oppenheim
and Willsky.

168
00:08:21,940 --> 00:08:25,360
But there is a map on the
website that gives you

169
00:08:25,360 --> 00:08:29,320
